<div style="background:#1e293b; padding:12px; border-radius:10px; margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px;">
<p style="font-weight:bold; color:#f59e0b; margin-bottom:8px; font-size:14px;">📺 Custom Room Join Karne Ka Tarika:</p>
<p style="font-size:13px; line-height:1.8; margin:0;">
1️⃣ Room ID copy karein (📋)<br>
2️⃣ Password copy karein (📋)<br>
3️⃣ "OPEN BGMI" button dabayein<br>
4️⃣ BGMI khulegi — Custom Room par jayein<br>
5️⃣ Room ID paste karein<br>
6️⃣ Password paste karein<br>
7️⃣ "Join Room" dabayein<br>
